Package: CDMRefreshCompare
Title: Compare OMOP CDM Data Refreshes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Mandickel", "Kamtengeni", , "mandickel@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for comparing successive
    refreshes of the Observational Medical Outcomes
    Partnership Common Data Model (OMOP CDM).
    Supports table-level record count comparisons
    to help developers investigate changes after
    extract, transform, and load (ETL) processes.
